    "chunk_text": "\u00fe\u00e6t is wilde elebeam, Her sindon dolh sealfa to eallum wundum & drencas & cl\u00e6snunga on gehwilce wisan ge utan ge on Eft dolhsealf, genim wegbr\u00e6dan s\u00e6d, getrifula smale, scead on \u00fea wunde. Sona bi\u00f0 selre. Wi\u00fe ealdre wunde tobrocenre, grundeswelge wi\u00fe ealdne rysele gemenged & on aled, lacna swilce To wunde cl\u00e6snunga genim cl\u00e6ne hunig, gewyrme to fyre, gedo \u00feonne on cl\u00e6ne f\u00e6t, do sealt to & Gif banbrice on heafde sie, mage\u00fean & gotwo\u00fean gecnuwa wel on hunige, do \u00feonne buteran on. \u00de\u00e6t bi\u00f0 god dolhsealf. Eft wi\u00f0 \u00feon eac bi\u00fe god lustmocan crop to lecganne on gebrocen heafod & gif hund slite. Wi\u00fe hundes slite genim \u00fea readan netlan & attorla\u00fean & spices, \u00e6lces emfela, seo\u00f0 on buteran, Sona beo\u00f0 \u00fea unnyttan ban ute. Dolhsealf wi\u00f0 lungenadle, hleomoce hatte wyrt, sio weaxe\u00f0 on broce, gewyrc \u00fea on morgenne Gecnuwa \u00fea hleomocan, meng wi\u00fe \u00feam gose scearne, do l\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6s scearnes, wyl on buteran, awring. \u00de\u00e6t bi\u00fe god sealf. Sealf, haran sprecel nim on ealdum lande & lungenwyrt, seo bi\u00fe geolu ufeweard, & \u00e6ges dydrin, Wi\u00fe innan wunde sealf, win, ele, galluc, hunig. Dolhsealf, gy\u00ferife & gelod wyrt & \u00fea brunan wyrt brad",
